stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  state "Checking for updates" as Checking
  state "Up to date" as UpToDate
  state "Update pending" as Pending
  [*] --> Checking
  Checking --> UpToDate: confirmed
  Checking --> Pending: newer version exists
  UpToDate --> Pending: new version published
  Pending --> UpToDate: applied
  Pending --> Declined: declined
  Declined --> Pending: an even newer version
